  m_Name: Dia_Classmate_GPA
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  lines:
  - text: "Mu\u1ED1n t\u0103ng GPA: \u0111i h\u1ECDc \u0111\xFAng gi\u1EDD, h\u1ECDc
      \u1EDF b\xE0n sau bu\u1ED5i s\xE1ng, l\xE0m quiz v\xE0 b\xE0i t\u1EADp \u0111\u1EA7y
      \u0111\u1EE7. Gi\u1EA3m stress c\u0169ng gi\xFAp \xF4n t\u1EADp hi\u1EC7u qu\u1EA3
      h\u01A1n."
    choices:
    - choiceText: "C\u1EA3m \u01A1n b\u1EA1n"
      type: 0
      nextNode: 
      rewardItem: {fileID: 0}
      quest: {fileID: 0}
      nextNodeOnSuccess: 
      nextNodeOnFail: 
  - text: "N\u1EBFu c\u1EA7n nhi\u1EC7m v\u1EE5 th\xEC h\u1ECFi th\u1EA7y gi\xE1o
      ho\u1EB7c xem m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu trong c\u1ED1t truy\u1EC7n \u2014 \u0111\xF4i
      khi b\u1EA1n c\u0169ng nh\u1EADn th\xEAm nhi\u1EC7m v\u1EE5 ph\u1EE5."
    choices:
    - choiceText: "\u0110\u01B0\u1EE3c r\u1ED3i"
      type: 2
      nextNode: 
      rewardItem: {fileID: 0}
      quest: {fileID: 0}
